#: flowview_filters.php
msgid "Materialization pre-computes the results of a Filter for each flow partition, with NAT on and off, and stores them in the Parallel Query cache, so reports over older data open quickly.  New partitions are materialized automatically once they stop receiving flows.  Required means partitions that have rotated are not materialized yet, Running means a materialization is in progress, and Up to date means every rotated partition is materialized.  Running: N is how many queries of the Filter are working now.  The partition still receiving flows is not materialized, so it does not count."
msgstr "Ny fampivainganana dia mikajy mialoha ny valin'ny Sivana iray ho an'ny fizarana fikorianana tsirairay, miaraka amin'ny NAT mandeha sy maty, ary mitahiry izany ao amin'ny fitadidiana vonjimaikan'ny Parallel Query, mba hisokatra haingana ny tatitra momba ny angona taloha.  Ampivainganina ho azy ireo fizarana vaovao raha vao mijanona tsy mandray fikorianana intsony.  Ny hoe Ilaina dia midika fa mbola tsy nampivainganina ireo fizarana nihodina, ny hoe Mandeha dia midika fa eo am-pampivainganana, ary ny hoe Ara-potoana dia midika fa efa nampivainganina daholo ny fizarana nihodina tsirairay.  Ny hoe Mandeha: N dia manondro ny isan'ny fangatahan'ny Sivana miasa amin'izao fotoana izao.  Tsy ampivainganina ny fizarana mbola mandray fikorianana, ka tsy isaina izany."

