msgstr "URL an'ny serivisy fangatahana"

#: setup.php
msgid "Base URL of the FlowView Query Service, for example http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Leave blank to auto-discover the ephemeral port from the service's port file."
msgstr "URL fototry ny Sampandraharaha Fanontaniana FlowView, ohatra http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Avelao ho foana mba hikarohana ho azy ny seranana vonjimaika avy amin'ny rakitra seranan'ny sampandraharaha."

